## Pagination

### Pagination Format

All list endpoints return Laravel's standard pagination format:

```json
{
  "data": [ ... items ... ],
  "links": {
    "first": "http://localhost/api/usuarios?page=1",
    "last": "http://localhost/api/usuarios?page=5",
    "prev": null,
    "next": "http://localhost/api/usuarios?page=2"
  },
  "meta": {
    "current_page": 1,
    "from": 1,
    "last_page": 5,
    "per_page": 15,
    "to": 15,
    "total": 72
  }
}
```

### Pagination Parameters

| Parameter | Type | Default | Description |
|-----------|------|---------|-------------|
| per_page | integer | 15 | Items per page (1-100) |
| page | integer | 1 | Page number |

### Pagination Examples

Get first 10 items:
```
GET /api/usuarios?per_page=10
```

Get page 3:
```
GET /api/usuarios?page=3
```

Get 5 items on page 2:
```
GET /api/usuarios?per_page=5&page=2
```

